### ===========================================
### Pruebas Spring Security - EmailSpring
### ===========================================

### 1️⃣ REGISTRAR USUARIO
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test123456",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "nombre": "Usuario de Prueba",
  "rol": "USER"
}

### 2️⃣ LOGIN - Obtener tokens JWT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 3️⃣ ACCEDER A ENDPOINT PROTEGIDO (Listar entrenamientos)
# Copia el accessToken de la respuesta anterior y pégalo aquí
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entrenamientos
Authorization: Bearer <PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN>

### 4️⃣ CREAR ENTRENAMIENTO (Solo ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/entrenamientos
Authorization: Bearer <PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN_DE_ADMIN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Rutina de Fuerza",
  "descripcion": "Entrenamiento de fuerza para principiantes"
}

### 5️⃣ HABILITAR 2FA - Paso 1: Generar QR
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/enable
Authorization: Bearer <PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN>

### 6️⃣ CONFIRMAR 2FA - Paso 2: Verificar código
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/confirm
Authorization: Bearer <PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}

### 7️⃣ OBTENER ESTADO 2FA
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/status
Authorization: Bearer <PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN>

### 8️⃣ LOGOUT (Revocar token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN>

### 9️⃣ REFRESCAR TOKEN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<PEGA_AQUI_EL_REFRESH_TOKEN>",
  "accessToken": "<PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRADO>"
}

### 🔟 VERIFICAR 2FA DURANTE LOGIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/2fa/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "codigo": "123456"
}

### ===================================
### PRUEBAS DE SEGURIDAD NEGATIVAS
### ===================================

### ❌ Acceder sin token (debe dar 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entrenamientos

### ❌ Acceder con token inválido (debe dar 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/entrenamientos
Authorization: Bearer token_invalido_123

### ❌ Usuario normal intentando crear entrenamiento (debe dar 403)
# Primero login como USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "user123"
}

###
# Luego intentar crear (debe fallar con 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/entrenamientos
Authorization: Bearer <PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN_DE_USER>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Intento fallido",
  "descripcion": "No debería funcionar"
}

### ===================================
### ACCESO A H2 CONSOLE (debe ser público)
### ===================================
### Abrir en navegador: http://localhost:8080/h2-console

### ===================================
### SWAGGER UI (debe ser público)
### ===================================
### Abrir en navegador: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

